<Base title="Operational readiness" current="services">
  <h1>Operational readiness</h1>
  <p>Checking that a service is ready for production before it goes live, and that the people running it can keep it running.</p>
  <h2>What's included</h2>
  <p>Runbooks, monitoring and alerting coverage, failover and recovery checks, support handover, and a risk review with a clear go or no-go decision.</p>
  <h2>Who it's for</h2>
  <p>Teams launching a new service, taking over one, or moving one to production for the first time.</p>
  <p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Talk about your launch</a></p>
</Base>
